%description:
Tests a window update that opens a zero window (B14 of the staged landing). The
server reads at t=20, and the ACK of the next probe (t=32.411) offers 2000
bytes, below the probe octet, which the server did not accept. The client ends
the persist state and sends at once, from the probe octet on, and the ACK is
no duplicate ACK. The tester removes that segment: its retransmission comes
after the measured RTO of 1 s, because the persist timer did not change the RTO.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 36s
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 5000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.srv_tcp.advertisedWindow = 2000
*.srv_app.autoRead=false
*.srv_app.readScript="20 10000"
*.tcptester.script="a10 delete"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[32.409 A009] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:2002(1) ack 501 win 16384 
[32.411 B008] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 2000 
[32.413 A010] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:3001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 # deleting
[33.413 A011] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:3001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[33.615 B009] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 3001 win 1000 
[33.617 A012] A.1000 > B.2000: A 3001:4001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[33.819 B010] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 4001 win 0 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
The window update opens the window: cancelling the PERSIST timer
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
increasing RTO from 1s  to 2s
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%not-contains: stdout
Duplicate ACK
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
